# Create a Space keeps the sidebar's state: with the sidebar hidden it opens in the floating sidebar,
# which stays out while the space is made, and the sidebar is never docked for it, whether the space
# is made or the sheet cancelled. It was docked, and stayed docked after Create Space (10 Nov 2026;
# MainWindowController.showCreateSpace).
cra://debug?windowSize=1280x800
wait 2
cra://action/toggleSidebar
wait 1
cra://action/newSpace
wait 1
cra://debug?windowState=creating
expect-log window state creating: main0 .*docked=0 floating=1
cra://debug?createSpace=Fresh
wait 1
cra://debug?windowState=created
expect-log window state created: main0 .*docked=0
cra://action/newSpace
wait 1
cra://debug?windowState=again
expect-log window state again: main0 .*docked=0 floating=1
cra://debug?createSpace=cancel
wait 1
cra://debug?windowState=cancelled
expect-log window state cancelled: main0 .*docked=0
